          %h2#references References
          %p
            The use of homogeneous coordinates
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                  %msub
                    %mi x
                    %mn 1
                  %mo :
                  %mi ⋯
                  %mo :
                  %msub
                    %mi x
                    %mrow
                      %mi n
                      %mo +
                      %mn 1
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} [x_1 : \cdots: x_{n+1}]
            in order to include a “point at infinity” goes back to:
          %ul
            %li#Mobius27
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/August+Ferdinand+M%C3%B6bius"}> August Ferdinand Möbius
              \:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Der barycentrische Calcül – Ein neues Hülfsmittel zur analytischen Behandlung der Geometrie
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/bpt6k99419h/f25"} ark:12148/bpt6k99419h/f25
          %p Modern textbook accounts:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ronald+Brown"}> Ronald Brown
                , §5.3 of:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Elements of Modern Topology
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://archive.org/details/elementsofmodern0000rona/page/n1/mode/2up"} ark:/13960/s26wmm5260h
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Brown-Topology.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/William+S.+Massey"}> William S. Massey
                , §IX.3.6 &amp; §XV.2 in:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em A Basic Course in Algebraic Topology
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 127
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-1-4939-9063-4"} doi:10.1007/978-1-4939-9063-4
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Igor+R.+Shafarevich"}> Igor R. Shafarevich
                ,
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alexey+O.+Remizov"} Alexey O. Remizov
                %em Linear Algebra and Geometry
                (2012) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-30994-6"}> doi:10.1007/978-3-642-30994-6
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://maa.org/press/maa-reviews/linear-algebra-and-geometry"} MAA-review
          %p See also:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+Strickland"}> Neil Strickland
                , section 4 of:
